__d(function(o,e,t,n,a,h,r){a.exports={S:{h:"Something heavy came with you today.",p:"You don\u2019t have to explain it or hurry it along. Many people in Scripture carried something heavy too."},F:{h:"Worry for the people you love back home can follow you everywhere.",p:"Family, friends, news of conflict, or no news at all can keep your mind from resting. Someone in Scripture heard hard news about his people and brought it straight to God."},A:{h:"Something happened that shouldn\u2019t have.",p:"It\u2019s all right that it stirs you up. Scripture has room for people who cried out to God before their words were tidy."},J:{h:"Something good is close, even if it feels fragile.",p:"Good things belong in prayer too. You can bring this to God just as it is."},SF:{h:"You may be worn out, and afraid of what comes next.",p:"Someone in Scripture ran until he had nothing left. God met him there, gently."},SA:{h:"Loss can come with a question: why did this have to happen?",p:"You can bring the loss and the question to God together. You don\u2019t have to choose the polite one."},SJ:{h:"Something good and something painful are here at the same time.",p:"You don\u2019t have to choose one. Both can be true, and both can be brought to God."},FA:{h:"You may have been treated unfairly, and now you\u2019re not sure you\u2019re safe.",p:"Someone in Scripture ran from people who hurt her. In the wilderness, God saw her and called her by name."},FJ:{h:"Something good happened, and part of you is afraid it won\u2019t last.",p:"You can thank God and still tell Him what scares you. Someone in Scripture, after years of distress, called God her rock."},AJ:{h:"Something good is here, and something that hurt you is still real.",p:"Being thankful doesn\u2019t mean the wrong didn\u2019t matter. God can hold both, so you don\u2019t have to hold them alone."},NW:{h:"You don\u2019t have to find words right now.",p:"Someone in Scripture was too troubled to speak, and prayed anyway. You can let his words speak for you."}}},2394,[]);
